{offset200}{ia12}{offset0}

{arial}Anubis Station
Operator: Sergeant Barkod
Message: AN-32KR0005

from: {arialbld}Alex Kolman{arial}
Headquarters of Kafarna

to: {arialbld}{rank} {name}{arial}
Babel Oued Barracks





Kurt Rorscham will not be at your flank for this mission. Temporarily suspended from his duties, he has been asked to explain his role in the outbreak of a fight at the end of the Camel Derby of Casa Blanca. I admit having considerable difficulties making sense of this affair. He apparently confronted the jockey who finished last in the race, threw him to the ground, and even slapped his steed, Zephyra. Yet, under Jaffari law, any assault on a racing camel is a severely punishable offence. The Schyzo Chief of Staff is presently trying to establish a diplomatic resolution to this incident.


Our targets are henceforth the Tekton bases located in the north of the Kalamata plateau: {arialbld}Djebel Mezzerif{arial} and {arialbld}Djebel Gesserit{arial}, the latter being held by Otton Von Tekton...



{ia4}{offset100}Here is the profile of the eldest of the Von Tekton descendants.
{arialbld}Otton{arial}, 31 years old, once husband to the late Luviana Von Krotstein (dead in childbirth), now remarried to Gertrude de Kurtember, his 2nd wife.
Character: brutal and cruel, frequently drunk
Leisure Activity: first to practice the hunt of migratory birds with an 88 mm flak gun.
Distinctive Feature: Lost part of his frontal lobe following the explosion of the breech from a 105 mm cannon.{offset0}






Otton is preparing a massive offensive against Bob Renard's blockade at {arialbld}El Getar{arial}. You must join them and provide them with reinforcements immediately.

Our maritime lines in the Aged Sea now reestablished, you will receive some material capable of confronting Tekton power. Our mid-sized tank Mark III in particular (plans attached), exceptionally mobile, equipped with a 75 mm turret and improved armoring.














{center}{device10}

















If {arialbld}El Getar{arial} should fall, we will fall with it.

{offset150}{arialbld}Alex Kolman{arial}

Venerated Guide of the Normo Forces



{offset200}{signature1}{offset0}



